            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did add a little butter and hot milk to the potatoes when I mashed, just for fluffier and a little thinner mashed potatoes. I also used a homemade dry ranch dressing mix. We loved these--ate every single bite. NO leftovers.",
            "datePublished": "2012-12-12T03:54:20.257Z"
          },
          {
