              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BECKYHOME-ECKY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Ok - these were good, but I had to make some adjustments to make them taste how I thought they should. This recipe alone was good, but I replaced the cream with sour cream and added a touch of milk. Also, I put all of the potatoes into a baking dish, sprinkled with cheddar cheese and poured 3T. of melted margarine over the top...then they were DELICIOUS!!!!! Thanks.",
            "datePublished": "2004-08-16T10:16:20.873Z"
          },
