            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Shortstack<3"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I used low fat cream cheese and skim milk to lower the calories, but still tasted great! The only thing I will change is buying a different ranch mix next time, the generic one I bought gave too much of an onion flavor. Will definitely make again!!!",
